{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02663","headline":"句 · 王绩","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琴曲唯留古，书多半是经。\n横裁桑节杖，直剪竹皮巾。\n鹤警琴亭夜，莺啼酒瓮春。\n颜回唯乐道，原宪岂伤贫。\n寄身千载下，聊游万物初。\n欲令无作有，翻觉实成虚。\n双关防易断，只眼畏难全。\n鱼鳞张九拒，鹤翅拥三边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}